{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <h2>最新天文台天氣報告｜未來五天香港天氣預報</h2>\n    <p>天文台展望，未來數日漸轉天晴酷熱，但明早局部地區有驟雨。</p>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月24日(日)</cell>\n        <cell>5月25日(一)</cell>\n        <cell>5月26日(二)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>32度</cell>\n        <cell>32度</cell>\n        <cell>33度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風4級，高地5級。</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風4級，高地5級。</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風4級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>65-90%</cell>\n        <cell>65-90%</cell>\n        <cell>60-85%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>部分時間有陽光及炎熱。早上局部地區有驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>大致天晴及炎熱，但早上局部地區有驟雨。</cell>\n        <cell>大致天晴。日間酷熱。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n    <table>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>日期</cell>\n        <cell>5月27日(三)</cell>\n        <cell>5月28日(四)</cell>\n        <cell>5月29日(五)</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最高溫度</cell>\n        <cell>33度</cell>\n        <cell>33度</cell>\n        <cell>33度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>最低溫度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n        <cell>28度</cell>\n        <cell>27度</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>風向及級數</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風3至4級。</cell>\n        <cell>南至西南風3級。</cell>\n        <cell>西至西南風3級。</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>濕度</cell>\n        <cell>60-85%</cell>\n        <cell>60-85%</cell>\n        <cell>65-95%</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>顯著降雨概率</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>低</cell>\n        <cell>中低</cell>\n      </row>\n      <row span=\"4\">\n        <cell>天氣</cell>\n        <cell>大致天晴。日間酷熱。</cell>\n        <cell>大致天晴。日間酷熱。</cell>\n        <cell>部分時間有陽光。日間酷熱。稍後有幾陣驟雨，局部地區有雷暴。</cell>\n      </row>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-23T23:15:14.843606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":441,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}